            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "    vim/lsp/semantic_tokens.lua:86: attempt to index field 'semanticTokensProvider' (a userdata value)\r\n\r\nwhat Nvim version are you using? that looks like https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/40390  , i.e. the server is sending `null` in violation of the LSP spec. On master (0.13) with https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40475 , the error should be nicer at least.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, enabling sem tokens by default is fine 👍 ",
